  skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/mobility-data-standard> .

<https://w3id.org/mobilitydcat-ap/mobility-data-standard/gtfs> a skos:Concept, <https://w3id.org/mobilitydcatap#MobilityDataStandard>;
  skos:prefLabel "GTFS"@en;
  skos:definition "General Transit Feed Specification - Schedule (MobilityData)"@en;
